@Maintenance.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164

### MNT-02: list all interventions
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions
Accept: application/json

### MNT-02: filter by priority, location and status
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions?priority=High&location=King&status=To%20Do
Accept: application/json

### MNT-01: create an intervention (201 Created)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Pothole near bus stop",
  "location": "King Street North",
  "issueType": "Road",
  "priority": "High"
}

### MNT-01: missing required fields (400 Bad Request)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": ""
}

### ================= Sprint 3 =================
### Inbound messages need X-Source-Service; user actions send X-User-Id (audit, TEC-05).

### ESV-03 receive a weather alert (from E-services)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/weather-alerts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Source-Service: E-services

{ "externalAlertId": "EC-2026-0042", "title": "Freezing rain warning", "content": "Up to 10 mm of ice",
  "affectedArea": "King Street North", "severity": "Severe",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-26T06:00:00Z", "validTo": "2026-11-27T06:00:00Z" }

### ESV-03 list alerts awaiting review
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/weather-alerts?reviewStatus=Awaiting%20Review

### ESV-04 record an assessment
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/weather-alerts/1/assessments
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: mgr-01

{ "decision": "Action Required", "rationale": "Bridges and sidewalks will ice" }

### ESV-05 create an intervention from the alert (also: LinkInterventions, NoActionRequired, Reschedule, PutOnHold)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/weather-alerts/1/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: mgr-01

{ "type": "CreateIntervention", "priority": "High", "notes": "Salt the bridges" }

### BUD-01 cost estimate
PUT {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/1/budget/estimate
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: mgr-01

{ "repairCost": 1200, "materialCost": 350.50, "equipmentCost": 400 }

### BUD-02 submit to Budget
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/1/budget/submit
X-User-Id: mgr-01

### BUD-03 decision from Budget (use the budgetRequestReference returned above)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/budget/decisions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Source-Service: Budget

{ "decisionId": "DEC-77", "requestReference": "BUD-1001", "decision": "Approved", "approvedAmount": 1950.50,
  "comments": "Within Q4 envelope", "decidedBy": "B. Officer" }

### BUD-05 estimated vs actual
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/1/budget/comparison

### ESV-06 / SEC-03 / TRP-02 road closure to E-services, Security and Public Transport
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/1/road-closures
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: mgr-01

{ "closureStatus": "Closed", "plannedStart": "2026-11-28T08:00:00Z", "plannedEnd": "2026-11-28T16:00:00Z" }

### SEC-03 work-status update to Security
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/1/work-status-updates
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: mgr-01

{}

### REG-04 property disruption (link a property first)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/1/property-disruptions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: mgr-01

{ "disruptionType": "Water", "updateType": "New", "periodStart": "2026-11-28T08:00:00Z", "periodEnd": "2026-11-28T14:00:00Z" }

### REG-03 utilities of a property
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/properties/PR-1002/utilities

### SEC-01 assistance request to Security
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/1/security-requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: mgr-01

{ "reason": "Traffic control for lane closure", "periodStart": "2026-11-28T08:00:00Z", "periodEnd": "2026-11-28T16:00:00Z" }

### SEC-02 response from Security (use the securityReference returned above)
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/security/responses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Source-Service: Security

{ "responseId": "R1", "requestReference": "SEC-1001", "outcome": "Partially Approved", "comments": "One officer 08:00-12:00", "respondedBy": "Sgt. Lee" }

### STF-01 personnel from Staff
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/staff?specialization=Road

### STF-02 overlapping assignments
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interventions/2/conflicts

### TRP-01 routes and schedules
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transit/routes?street=King%20Street

### TRP-03 route change from Public Transport
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transit/diversions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Source-Service: Public Transport

{ "externalReference": "GRT-DIV-88", "affectedRoutes": ["7", "301"], "description": "Detour via Regina St",
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-11-28T05:00:00Z", "effectiveTo": "2026-11-29T23:00:00Z" }

### TEC-03 switch a mock service off (to test failures) / on
PUT {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/mock-services/Budget/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{ "available": false }

### TEC-04 failed exchanges / retry
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/exchanges?status=Failed

### TEC-04 retry exchange 2
POST {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/exchanges/2/retry

### TEC-05 audit history
GET {{Maintenance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audit?entityType=Intervention&entityId=1
